毛，眼睛为棕色为设计草图。并包括尺寸和解释性文本注释。应使用线条和测量值来指示各个部位的尺寸给草图以技术和详细的感觉。除了主要设计外，还包括显示不同角度的零散缩略图，立体景深","sample_steps":16,"large_image_info":{"height":2560,"width":1440,"resolution_type":"2k"},"sample_strength":0.5},"template_id":"7639995078710185226","aigc_mode":"workbench","insta_drag_params":{"origin_item_id":null},"hide_ref_images":false,"reference_prompt":"蓝图风格设计草图，Q版毛茸茸榴莲精灵玩偶，黄绿色短毛覆盖全身，棕色圆眼睛，身体圆润。画面包含正面、侧面、背面零散缩略图，立体景深效果。各部位用线条标注尺寸，测量值旁有解释性文本注释，如\"头部：8cm\"、\"身体：12cm\"、\"刺长：3cm\"、\"手臂：5cm\"、\"腿部：6cm\"。线条清晰，文本注释为黑色宋体，整体呈现技术详细感，草图氛围。","image_type":3},"statistic":{"usage_num":63,"favorite_num":682,"play_num":0},"category_id_list":[],"aigc_flow":{"version":"3.0.2"},"ref_item":{"common_attr":{"id":"7639995078710185226","effect_id":"7639995078710185226","effect_type":9,"description":"","cover_url":"https://p11-dreamina-sign.byteimg.com/tos-cn-i-tb4s082cfz/e22e5fc17196495eab25c84e45b58b44~tplv-tb4s082cfz-aigc_resize:640:640.jpeg?lk3s=4fa96020\u0026x-expires=1819961597\u0026x-signature=zitHSIRoDn4RoVkz167zOQBYlcc%3D","cover_url_map":null,"smart_crop_loc":null,"status":102,"title":"榴莲精灵玩偶"},"author":{"name":"西郡生活","avatar_url":"https://p6-faceu-img-sign.byteimg.com/tos-cn-i-tb4s082cfz/7d5e3d28f9d845e2866659e07f4b75dc~tplv-resize:200:200.webp?lk3s=4eecb9e8\u0026x-expires=1791017597\u0026x-signature=u0FkXTenm6pLT3WkPMzcCHS5rcg%3D","uid":"1750057121487620","sec_uid":"MS4wLjABAAAAvtPwkO6ElTOT-fpmpOTR75kPx_rhWzrJf2Zkc2oCzEOX7fL3HMRyEEyZ28JEdFNK","description":"心中有景，眼下即梦","has_followed":false,"followed_req_uid":false,"status":0,"account_type":0},"feature":"","extra":{"template_type":"image","ai_feature":"text_generate_image"}},"aigc_draft":{"version":"3.0.2","uri":"aigc-draft/13077851998988","content":"{\"type\":\"draft\",\"id\":\"8806d584-6e3f-4c94-b973-c86370fbbfff\",\"min_version\":\"3.0.2\",\"min_features\":[],\"is_from_tsn\":true,\"version\":\"3.0.2\",\"main_component_id\":\"33c3bfbb-98a1-4bfa-9de7-aa75252fa810\",\"component_list\":[{\"type\":\"image_base_component\",\"id\":\"33c3bfbb-